	(text "A crystal oscillator is an electronic circuit \nthat uses the mechanical resonance of a vibrating \npiezoelectric crystal (typically quartz) to create \nan electrical signal with a highly precise and stable frequency."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.732 134.112 0)
		(effects
